From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: metaX contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dahlia: use exact WordPress REST lookup for search

The shared DAHLIA/FALENO provider still used legacy HTML search even after
detail metadata moved to the WordPress REST API. Use the same exact-slug
lookup for search, return the public work-page URL, and reject fuzzy slug
matches before they can be shown to Jellyfin.

Based on metatube-community/metatube-sdk-go commit
c62584675c593816cc07e7b5b977d14c7eb505a3.

---
 provider/dahlia/core/core.go                       | search implementation
 provider/dahlia/core/core_wordpress_search_test.go | 117 +++
 2 files changed

